    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/fd1f28a14b279419a8fc70a54d620437.avif?t=1749739117\" width=568 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share you feedback, report bugs and follow latest news about the game!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deus Mantle</strong> is a progression-based survival sandbox, where you find yourself exploring infinite procedurely-generated worlds full of danger and mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get prepared to face dangerous creatures to fulfill the will of the gods, and through these hardships you may just find your way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/c4bd7ed65541720b570d023b4b303ea7.webp?t=1749739117\" width=507 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has unique materials you can gather  and unique challenges to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/a8768dd7eab9d457c804beaead52e9db.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/a8768dd7eab9d457c804beaead52e9db.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/a8768dd7eab9d457c804beaead52e9db.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tasty chilli peppers in Sandy Desert, dig up snowballs in Snowy Forest and get lost in Deep Forest looking for those\u00a0precious berries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/338a875ebab11d0fedb6ec7b727deada.webp?t=1749739117\" width=569 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through technology tree, unlocking different items, buildings and game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9f3df6b31ae8c8e1193e614ad15d2700.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9f3df6b31ae8c8e1193e614ad15d2700.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9f3df6b31ae8c8e1193e614ad15d2700.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From zero to building magical factories to make materials, so you can enchant those materials to make materials faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/498741f44bfabb55afb094ecd528965d.webp?t=1749739117\" width=407 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all the materials you found to build your own base the way you want it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/36384c236835cd649df31af52189eb2a.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/36384c236835cd649df31af52189eb2a.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/36384c236835cd649df31af52189eb2a.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home with furniture, optimize how you make materials with automation and don't forget to water your crops!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/f11aa7d25d8dc96a585c9680ecc814d4.webp?t=1749739117\" width=436 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash enemies with the equipment you built, or combo-wombo your way through them with elemental magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9376534ab0d4098adb64d478e4d5a907.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9376534ab0d4098adb64d478e4d5a907.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9376534ab0d4098adb64d478e4d5a907.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself to challenge difficult bosses to get unique rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deus Mantle</strong> is a progression-based survival sandbox, where you find yourself exploring infinite procedurely-generated worlds full of danger and mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get prepared to face dangerous creatures to fulfill the will of the gods, and through these hardships you may just find your way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/c4bd7ed65541720b570d023b4b303ea7.webp?t=1749739117\" width=507 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has unique materials you can gather  and unique challenges to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/a8768dd7eab9d457c804beaead52e9db.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/a8768dd7eab9d457c804beaead52e9db.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/a8768dd7eab9d457c804beaead52e9db.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tasty chilli peppers in Sandy Desert, dig up snowballs in Snowy Forest and get lost in Deep Forest looking for those\u00a0precious berries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/338a875ebab11d0fedb6ec7b727deada.webp?t=1749739117\" width=569 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through technology tree, unlocking different items, buildings and game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9f3df6b31ae8c8e1193e614ad15d2700.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9f3df6b31ae8c8e1193e614ad15d2700.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9f3df6b31ae8c8e1193e614ad15d2700.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From zero to building magical factories to make materials, so you can enchant those materials to make materials faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/498741f44bfabb55afb094ecd528965d.webp?t=1749739117\" width=407 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all the materials you found to build your own base the way you want it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/36384c236835cd649df31af52189eb2a.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/36384c236835cd649df31af52189eb2a.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/36384c236835cd649df31af52189eb2a.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home with furniture, optimize how you make materials with automation and don't forget to water your crops!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/f11aa7d25d8dc96a585c9680ecc814d4.webp?t=1749739117\" width=436 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash enemies with the equipment you built, or combo-wombo your way through them with elemental magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9376534ab0d4098adb64d478e4d5a907.poster.avif?t=1749739117\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9376534ab0d4098adb64d478e4d5a907.webm?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116870/extras/9376534ab0d4098adb64d478e4d5a907.mp4?t=1749739117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself to challenge difficult bosses to get unique rewards.</p>",
